          "filename": "Merchant Hotel Chandelier by Marcus Notley.jpg",
          "caption": "In 2006 Marcus Notley completed the design of Ireland’s largest crystal chandelier.  It was specially commissioned by the 5 star Merchant Hotel in Belfast. This lavish chandelier is 2 stories in height. It is constructed with over 2600 pieces of crystal on a gilded gold metalwork frame, all of which is suspended from a glass dome above the hotel's Great Room restaurant.",
